<title>UK: Bayer Corp sets 200 mln Sfr bond due 2002.</title>
<headline>Bayer Corp sets 200 mln Sfr bond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYER CORP PITTSBURG</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BAYER AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.25	MATURITY    23.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.80     PAY DATE    23.APR.97</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   16.APR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
